    heading('STATES IN SPACE & TIME',cloud?'Where the computed states sit.':'Follow the retained checkpoints.',cloud?'Each marker is a saved airborne state at 00:19:37. Compare experiments and terminal assumptions.':'Step through saved states to connect the path with height, speed, fuel and mass.',cloud?'FINAL TRANSMISSION · 00:19:37 UTC':'SAVED MODEL STATES · UTC');
